        "intent_summary": "Refactor configfs group registration to use modern API and remove unnecessary work_struct indirection",
        "what": "Changed configfs_register_group to configfs_add_default_group API call; renamed function from pci_epf_cfs_work to pci_epf_cfs_add_sub_groups; removed work_struct parameter and container_of extraction; function now takes epf_group pointer directly",
