        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Ensures synchronous creation of configfs sub-groups during endpoint function initialization by replacing deferred work with immediate execution.",
        "what": "Replaced the initialization and queuing of a delayed work item (INIT_DELAYED_WORK and queue_delayed_work) with a direct function call to pci_epf_cfs_add_sub_groups.",
        "how": "Changes the execution flow from asynchronous (scheduled to run 1ms later on system_wq) to synchronous (executed immediately), ensuring sub-groups are created before pci_epf_make returns."
